{"type":"text","timestamp":1789228128280,"sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","part":{"id":"prt_0964e7473001ewQrTmShBtFHEK","messageID":"msg_0964e2f17001t4ELhcQAPcRzCj","sessionID":"ses_f69b53dfaffe6jVh3DZezfRAcf","type":"text","text":"梯度檢查表格很漂亮（誤差隨 $h$ 下降，到 $h=10^{-5}$ 最小後因捨入誤差回升）。但 `max |w_ours - w_sklearn| = 6.4` 偏大，先診斷一下：因為 digits 3/8 高維可分離，係數可能很大或收斂程度不同。查一下兩邊係數範數與交叉 loss。","time":{"start":1789228119155,"end":1789228128278}}}
